Based on the tool definition for `processWorkflowCommand`, it requires a top-level body argument with a specific structure. I will make sure to provide the correct parameters.

To check your current onboarding status, please call the `processWorkflowCommand` tool with the following parameters:

```json
{
  "body": {
    "metadata": {
      "operation": "GET_STATE",
      "requestId": "new correlation ID",
      "referenceId": "onboarding reference ID"
    },
    "payload": {}
  }
}
```

This should provide you with the current status of your onboarding process.
